Explain:

The navigation is organised around Holmes' primary activities rather than technical system functions.

Slide 7 — User Journey

Urgent Investigation Workflow

Urgent Case Received
        ↓
   Notification
        ↓
     Dashboard
        ↓
     Case #31
        ↓
   Case Details
        ↓
      Schedule
        ↓
 Conflict Detected
        ↓
Review Alternatives
        ↓
Reschedule Existing Event
        ↓
 Updated Schedule

UX objective:

Reduce the number of decisions the user must make manually.

