Slide 10 — Intelligent UX Feature
Schedule Conflict Detection

This should be one of your strongest slides.

Show the conflict modal screenshot.

Example:

Existing Event
14:00 – 15:30
Evidence Analysis — Case #27

             ↓

New Urgent Event
14:30 – 16:00
Scotland Yard Investigation

             ↓

60 MINUTE OVERLAP

The system provides:

Reschedule existing event
Accept both events
Cancel new investigation
Why this matters

Instead of allowing the user to discover the conflict manually, the system proactively identifies it and presents possible actions.

