Slide 12 — Usability Testing & Conclusion
Usability Testing

Participant:

An accessible representative user rather than Sherlock Holmes, since Holmes is fictional.

Testing tasks:

Find urgent investigation
Open Case #31
Review case
Open schedule
Add urgent investigation
Identify conflict
Resolve conflict
Open Deduction Board

Then include actual findings after your test.

Conclusion

The 221B interface combines scheduling, investigation management and intelligent prioritisation into a single responsive system designed around Sherlock Holmes' workflow.